## QueryWrapper 使用规范

### 基本查询
```java
// 等值查询
QueryWrapper<User> wrapper = new QueryWrapper<>();
wrapper.eq("username", "admin");
wrapper.eq("status", 1);
User user = userMapper.selectOne(wrapper);

// 模糊查询
wrapper.like("username", "admin");      // %admin%
wrapper.likeLeft("username", "admin");  // %admin
wrapper.likeRight("username", "admin"); // admin%

// 范围查询
wrapper.gt("age", 18);      // >
wrapper.ge("age", 18);      // >=
wrapper.lt("age", 60);      // <
wrapper.le("age", 60);      // <=
wrapper.between("age", 18, 60);

// IN查询
wrapper.in("id", Arrays.asList(1, 2, 3));

// NULL判断
wrapper.isNull("email");
wrapper.isNotNull("phone");

// 排序
wrapper.orderByAsc("create_time");
wrapper.orderByDesc("id");
```

### Lambda查询 (推荐)
```java
LambdaQueryWrapper<User> wrapper = new LambdaQueryWrapper<>();
wrapper.eq(User::getUsername, "admin")
       .eq(User::getStatus, 1)
       .like(StringUtils.isNotBlank(keyword), User::getNickName, keyword)
       .orderByDesc(User::getCreateTime);

List<User> users = userMapper.selectList(wrapper);
```

### 更新
```java
// UpdateWrapper
UpdateWrapper<User> wrapper = new UpdateWrapper<>();
wrapper.set("status", 0)
       .eq("id", 1);
userMapper.update(null, wrapper);

// LambdaUpdateWrapper
LambdaUpdateWrapper<User> wrapper = new LambdaUpdateWrapper<>();
wrapper.set(User::getStatus, 0)
       .eq(User::getId, 1);
userMapper.update(null, wrapper);
```

## 分页查询规范

```java
@Override
public IPage<UserVo> pageUsers(UserQueryParam param) {
    // 构建分页对象
    Page<User> page = new Page<>(param.getCurrent(), param.getSize());
    
    // 构建查询条件
    LambdaQueryWrapper<User> wrapper = new LambdaQueryWrapper<>();
    wrapper.like(StringUtils.isNotBlank(param.getUsername()), 
                 User::getUsername, param.getUsername())
           .eq(param.getDeptId() != null, User::getDeptId, param.getDeptId())
           .orderByDesc(User::getCreateTime);
    
    // 执行分页查询
    IPage<User> userPage = userMapper.selectPage(page, wrapper);
    
    // 转换为VO
    return userPage.convert(user -> UserConvert.INSTANCE.toVo(user));
}
```

## 多租户配置

### 租户拦截器
```java
@Bean
public MybatisPlusInterceptor mybatisPlusInterceptor() {
    MybatisPlusInterceptor interceptor = new MybatisPlusInterceptor();
    
    // 多租户插件
    interceptor.addInnerInterceptor(new TenantLineInnerInterceptor(new TenantLineHandler() {
        @Override
        public Expression getTenantId() {
            // 从上下文获取租户ID
            return new LongValue(TenantContextHolder.getTenantId());
        }
        
        @Override
        public String getTenantIdColumn() {
            return "tenant_id";
        }
        
        @Override
        public boolean ignoreTable(String tableName) {
            // 忽略的表
            return Arrays.asList("sys_tenant", "sys_config").contains(tableName);
        }
    }));
    
    return interceptor;
}
```

## SQL文件存放位置
- 初始化SQL: `sql/` 目录
- 表结构SQL: `sys_xxx.sql`
- 数据SQL: `sys_xxx_数据.sql`
